Subject: [PATCH 11/43] Fix ordering problem by draining downstream bus

---
 src/axi_riscv_amos.sv | 26 +++++++++++++++++++-------
 1 file changed, 19 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/axi_riscv_amos.sv b/src/axi_riscv_amos.sv
