Date: Fri, 25 Feb 2022 11:06:38 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 31/43] axi_riscv_atomics_tb: Relax clock period to 10 ns

Without manually setting the time resolution (which can cause problems
if not all modules use the same time resolution), a clock period of
1 ns is problematic when the default time resolution is 1 ns: waits of
sub-ns duration will then not be executed properly.
---
